{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2024-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1706054400, "end_date": 1706745599, "month_true_total": 1020, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:54:37 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "157288214", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979793819", "personaname": "ATLien", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197979793819/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 396, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 381, "last_played": 1706823655, "avatar": "0f26428e61e9837d926fe4cb92af7ed48ba911fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like the Dark Souls-like format and mechanics, but with guns, then this is a game I can easily recommend. The graphics are good, not ultra good. Even remastered older games, like Crysis and Mass Effect, look WAAAAAAAAAAAAAAY better. But it's still a great game for what it is. Just don't level up your gear until you are in a new arena that is higher than your level, then level up to 1 level higher. If you level up your gear too much, the game just adjusts to it. The arenas are procedurally generated, so no two play-throughs will be identical. Lots of good here, if you're already a fan of the Souls model games. If not, then pass on this.", "timestamp_created": 1706740010, "timestamp_updated": 1706740010, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157286858", "author": {"steamid": "76561198243506718", "personaname": "SteveDoesThings", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/stevedoesthings/", "num_games_owned": 677, "num_reviews": 66, "playtime_forever": 6581, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3066, "last_played": 1739315918, "avatar": "3b2a0296bf185d3644001bc40b83d75260901ff7"}, "language": "english", "review": "no one told me they made video games hard", "timestamp_created": 1706738263, "timestamp_updated": 1706738263, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157284370", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995647429", "personaname": "QC8472", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/QC8472/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 56820, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 23518, "deck_playtime_at_review": 11, "last_played": 1785955846, "avatar": "2dfefbcbdcd1e34be3176fa77df613b6ac7522e7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game that allows much more diversity than other souls-like games. Personally the only game in which I've completed and gotten absolutely everything.", "timestamp_created": 1706735285, "timestamp_updated": 1706735285, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157283778", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987097234", "personaname": "Lowkey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197987097234/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 5308, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4743, "last_played": 1780795511, "avatar": "9b2faad27b90c2a62e6b9b3a613e9e81a92f1c0b"}, "language": "english", "review": "It you played Remnant 1 and have been looking for something similar it will scratch the itch.", "timestamp_created": 1706734635, "timestamp_updated": 1706734635, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157282203", "author": {"steamid": "76561198213181796", "personaname": "Jinjy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198213181796/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 4467, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 637, "last_played": 1710448302, "avatar": "830e049b79a3d023bc3f71ed431613400cf95fdf"}, "language": "english", "review": "oh, yeah", "timestamp_created": 1706732948, "timestamp_updated": 1706732948, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157279138", "author": {"steamid": "76561198077330085", "personaname": "Mikeye", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198077330085/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 12507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6138, "last_played": 1746746650, "avatar": "95d8f1c00bbdc43e289e494f3dad027a6f930ac4"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is great in so many different ways. The procedurally generated aspect means if you join a friend you'll get a different experience leading up to the bosses and maybe different bosses. The guns, story, hidden puzzles that you have to use what's in your roll of the world to figure out, and all the secrets make this game absolutely outstanding.", "timestamp_created": 1706729762, "timestamp_updated": 1706729762, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157269812", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025008029", "personaname": "interslice", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025008029/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 46840, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19944, "last_played": 1778387715, "avatar": "17114eff3024f56535bef4ad9816db6a1e64f84e"}, "language": "english", "review": "best game of the last 5 years easy.", "timestamp_created": 1706719943, "timestamp_updated": 1706719943, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157260367", "author": {"steamid": "76561199545101196", "personaname": "Effect", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199545101196/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 10245, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4598, "last_played": 1728234117, "avatar": "b2edbc430cffa963966ebafc9e7844414a9c51c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yap! \n9/10\nFor a souls fan this game could be viewed as \"souls-with-guns\"\nFor non souls fans could be a tough run.\nFor those wanting to be challenged its great, it has similarities for sure with souls, but it has all been done very good where you have that \"oh heck yeah I got this boss down after _insert number of tries_\". Both souls fans and non-fans are in for a treat with this one. Solo play is very good I enjoyed it thorougly in 3 campaing clears, But co-op that gives you friendly fire where you can just goof around with your friends, pvp if wanted, explore, push them off a cliff or anything that comes to mind really is what sets it out from its peers.", "timestamp_created": 1706710834, "timestamp_updated": 1706710834, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157241739", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165276309", "personaname": "jbnath.nath86", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198165276309/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 5482, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1753, "last_played": 1709823378, "avatar": "e7d6949a64732d0c33badececcda52c417a4eb76"}, "language": "english", "review": "This time the game developers had made a significant progress with the archetypes and the game as a whole. It has also become lot easier to join others games and play with them contrary to the system that was in Remnant 1. I am eagerly waiting for Remnant 3.", "timestamp_created": 1706685833, "timestamp_updated": 1706685833, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}